#: ../../source/docs/flight-modes.rst:81 a20da3ae7621401381353e4eb057f561
msgid ""
"MANUAL: Lateral movement, VELOCITY: Full throw attempts to obtain "
"``MAX_VEL_XY`` m/s laterally, LOITER: Full throw attempts to obtain "
"``MAX_POS_XY`` m/s laterally"
msgstr ""
"MANUAL：横向移动；VELOCITY：满杆时尝试达到 ``MAX_VEL_XY`` m/s 的横向速度；LOITER：满杆时尝试达到 "
"``MAX_POS_XY`` m/s 的横向速度"

#: ../../source/docs/flight-modes.rst:84 727d6935eaa54f6780c85990c9cadfbf
msgid "PITCH"
msgstr "PITCH（俯仰）"

#: ../../source/docs/flight-modes.rst:84 a5cc3968797f41038f5e088b3e004355
msgid ""
"MANUAL: Fore/Aft movement, VELOCITY: Full throw attempts to obtain "
"``MAX_VEL_XY`` m/s  fore/aft, LOITER: Full throw attempts to obtain "
"``MAX_POS_XY`` m/s  fore/aft"
msgstr ""
"MANUAL：前后移动；VELOCITY：满杆时尝试达到 ``MAX_VEL_XY`` m/s 的前后速度；LOITER：满杆时尝试达到 "
"``MAX_POS_XY`` m/s 的前后速度"

#: ../../source/docs/flight-modes.rst:87 87b96530b108411495d2f18fd3bad5a9
msgid "YAW"
msgstr "YAW（偏航）"

#: ../../source/docs/flight-modes.rst:87 dce850f24ec34e89baf7374d437a1e82
msgid ""
"MANUAL: Yaw, VELOCITY: Full throw attempts to increase/decrease heading "
"``MAX_VEL_YAW`` radians/s  fore/aft, LOITER: Full throw attempts to "
"increase/decrease heading ``MAX_POS_YAW`` radians/s  fore/aft"
msgstr ""
"MANUAL：偏航；VELOCITY：满杆时尝试以 ``MAX_VEL_YAW`` rad/s 增加/减小航向；LOITER：满杆时尝试以 "
"``MAX_POS_YAW`` rad/s 增加/减小航向"

#: ../../source/docs/flight-modes.rst:90 6cfb5cc9bb7d45ee8696a47dfbc639f4
msgid "THROTTLE"
msgstr "THROTTLE（油门）"

#: ../../source/docs/flight-modes.rst:90 4da2ab340dbc4937afef2688cfd165e1
msgid ""
"MANUAL: Ascend/Descend, VELOCITY: Full throw attempts to increase/decrease "
"altitude ``MAX_VEL_Z`` m/s, LOITER: Full throw attempts to increase/decrease"
" heading ``MAX_POS_Z`` m/s"
msgstr ""
"MANUAL：上升/下降；VELOCITY：满杆时尝试以 ``MAX_VEL_Z`` m/s 增加/减小高度；LOITER：满杆时尝试以 "
"``MAX_POS_Z`` m/s 增加/减小高度"
